  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>ComStar organized its military forces around a combined-arms doctrine that valued infantry as an essential element of the Level I through Level VI command structure, with conventional platoons serving alongside BattleMechs, armor, and aerospace assets at every echelon. Crewing medium-caliber field autocannon, these gunners provide direct fire support with enough hitting power to threaten light armor while remaining mobile enough to reposition as the tactical situation evolves.</p>"
